-generation or plan-adjustment actions","when":"The screen renders using the user's returned permissions"}],"ears":"The feedlot web app shall let authorized planners generate or adjust dated pen-level feed plans from bunk rates, ration assignments, and animal counts, and display the returned plan details and execution status.","id":"REQ-9","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","ASM-8","ASM-20","Q-7"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A saved plan's pen count, bunk rate, animal count, or ration assignment changes after generation","id":"AC-10.1","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays the saved plan unchanged and a review flag","when":"The user opens the plan"},{"given":"An authorized planner opens a plan flagged for review","id":"AC-10.2","level":"ui","then":"The screen shows authorized confirm-update and regenerate actions","when":"The plan screen renders"},{"given":"An authorized planner confirms an update or regenerates a flagged plan","id":"AC-10.3","level":"ui","then":"The plan request contains the selected action and the screen displays the response status and returned plan","when":"The planner submits the selected action"},{"given":"An operator is assigned to the plan's pen","id":"AC-10.4","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays the returned status value for that pen's plan","when":"The operator updates the execution status"},{"given":"Actual bunk intake differs from the saved plan","id":"AC-10.5","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays actual intake and variance while the saved plan values remain unchanged","when":"The user views the feeding plan and activity"},{"given":"An operator is not assigned to the plan's pen and the screen renders using the operator's returned permissions","id":"AC-10.6","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays the current status and does not show an enabled status-update action","when":"The operator opens the plan"},{"given":"The service refuses a status update submitted by an operator who is not assigned to the plan's pen","id":"AC-10.7","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays the returned refusal error and the current plan status remains displayed","when":"The operator submits the status update"}],"ears":"The feedlot web app shall flag a saved plan for review when relevant inputs change, retain its saved values until an authorized planner confirms an update or regenerates it, allow assigned-pen operators to update execution status while withholding enabled status-update actions from other operators and displaying returned refusals for rejected updates, and show intake variance without automatically rewriting the saved plan.","id":"REQ-10","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","ASM-7","ASM-8","ASM-19","ASM-30","Q-7"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An operational user enters feeding date, pen, ration, planned quantity, actual delivered quantity, and status for a pen containing one or more lots","id":"AC-11.1","level":"ui","then":"The feeding request contains the entered fields and a delivered-quantity allocation for each affected lot, and the screen displays the response status and returned event fields including the lot allocations","when":"The user submits the feeding event"},{"given":"A successful feeding response contains calculated values","id":"AC-11.2","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays actual-minus-planned variance, feed cost, energy value, inventory consumed by ingredient, and cumulative lot feed consumption and cost","when":"The event screen renders the response"},{"given":"A successful feeding response contains planned quantity of 100 pounds, actual delivered quantity of 115 pounds, and a returned variance value of 15 pounds","id":"AC-11.3","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays the returned variance value of 15 pounds","when":"The event screen renders the response"},{"given":"A feeding response includes actual delivered quantity and an inventory movement","id":"AC-11.4","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays stock consumption for the delivered quantity and known wastage as a separate movement rather than added delivered feed","when":"The event screen renders the response"},{"given":"The service refuses a feeding event because available stock is insufficient","id":"AC-11.5","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays the returned stock error and does not display the event as saved","when":"The user submits the event"},{"given":"A user without operational access opens feeding activity","id":"AC-11.6","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays existing activity without an action to record a feeding event","when":"The screen renders"},{"given":"A feeding-event save request times out without a definitive response","id":"AC-11.7","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays that the save outcome is unknown and retains the submitted event fields","when":"The web app handles the timeout"},{"given":"A user has returned permission to correct or void saved feeding events","id":"AC-11.10","level":"ui","then":"The screen shows correction and void actions","when":"The user opens a saved feeding event"},{"given":"A user lacks returned permission to correct or void saved feeding events","id":"AC-11.11","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays the event without enabled correction or void actions","when":"The user opens a saved feeding event"},{"given":"An authorized user submits a correction and the service returns the corrected event with updated inventory movement and lot totals","id":"AC-11.12","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays the returned corrected event, inventory movement, and lot consumption and cost totals","when":"The correction response is displayed"},{"given":"An authorized user submits a void and the service returns the voided event with updated inventory movement and lot totals","id":"AC-11.13","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays the returned void status, inventory movement, and lot consumption and cost totals","when":"The void response is displayed"}],"ears":"The feedlot web app shall let operational users record feeding activity by pen and lot, including per-lot allocations when a pen contains multiple lots, display the returned variance, cost, energy, inventory consumption, feeding status, and lot-level consumption and cost totals, display a returned stock error when insufficient stock prevents saving, provide permission-controlled correction and void actions for saved feeding events, and display a timed-out save outcome as unknown while leaving retry resolution to the existing service/user workflow.","id":"REQ-11","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-5","I-6","ASM-4","ASM-9","ASM-10","ASM-11","ASM-20","ASM-28","ASM-31","ASM-32","ASM-34","Q-5","Q-7","Q-10"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An authorized user enters a lot weight measurement","id":"AC-12.1","level":"ui","then":"The measurement request contains lot, date, animals weighed, average animal weight, total lot weight when entered, and notes, and the screen displays the response status and saved measurement","when":"The user submits the measurement"},{"given":"The weight response contains multiple measurements","id":"AC-12.2","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays returned measurements in date order with weight gain since the previous measurement where returned","when":"A user views the lot's weight history"},{"given":"A user without measurement-entry access opens a lot's weight history","id":"AC-12.3","level":"ui","then":"The screen displays the measurement time series without an enabled add-measurement action","when":"The screen renders"}],"ears":"The feedlot web app shall let authorized livestock or operations users add lot weight measurements and display each lot's measurement history as a time-ordered series with returned measurement and gain information.","id":"REQ-12","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-7","ASM-12","Q-8"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"The lot metrics response contains receiving date, entry and current average weight, feed totals, feed cost, target weight, ADG, and projected ship date","id":"AC-13.1","